    <div>

      <p begin="00:10.210" end="00:13.110" ttm:agent="v1">다친대도, 길을 걸어, kiss me</p>

      <p begin="00:13.110" end="00:16.050" ttm:agent="v1">쉽지 않음 내가 쉽게 easy</p>

      <p begin="00:16.050" end="00:18.910" ttm:agent="v1">Stage, 위엔 불이 튀어, 내 body</p>

      <p begin="00:18.910" end="00:21.840" ttm:agent="v1">Pull up and I rip it up like ballet</p>

      <p begin="00:21.840" end="00:27.620" ttm:agent="v1">Damn, I really make it look easy</p>

      <p begin="00:27.620" end="00:34.580" ttm:agent="v1">Yuh, know that I make it look easy</p>

      <p begin="00:34.580" end="00:36.910" ttm:agent="v1">Clap your hands, 너도 나와 같다면</p>

      <p begin="00:36.910" end="00:40.340" ttm:agent="v1">Clap your hands now (dream, dream, dream)</p>

      <p begin="00:40.340" end="00:46.130" ttm:agent="v1">의구심 따윈 그냥 치워, 그냥 말해 &quot;I'm the real one&quot; (sheesh, sheesh, sheesh)</p>

      <p begin="00:46.130" end="00:49.830" ttm:agent="v1">조명 꺼진 뒤의 난 wander in the night</p>

      <p begin="00:49.830" end="00:52.510" ttm:agent="v1">Don't know what is right, don't know 'bout my rights</p>

      <p begin="00:52.510" end="00:55.250" ttm:agent="v1">시기심, 의심, 불신, 이젠 friends of me, yuh</p>

      <p begin="00:55.250" end="00:58.190" ttm:agent="v1">세상에게 난 반쪽짜리 seraphim, yuh</p>

      <p begin="00:58.190" end="01:01.010" ttm:agent="v1">Mm, mm-mm, mm</p>

      <p begin="01:01.010" end="01:06.080" ttm:agent="v1">I've been tryin' so long to show you, show you, show you (oh)</p>

      <p begin="01:06.080" end="01:08.480" ttm:agent="v1">I'm the one that you need</p>

      <p begin="01:08.480" end="01:11.350" ttm:agent="v1">다친대도, 길을 걸어, kiss me</p>

